<h1 class="title">SELF-HEALING CI/CD PIPELINE</h1><div class="sub">AI-POWERED • AUTOMATED • RESILIENT</div>
<section class="section"><div class="label">HIGH LEVEL PROCESS FLOW</div><div class="process">
<div class="step"><div class="num">1</div><div class="icon">🖥️</div><h3>MONITOR<br>PIPELINE</h3><p>Continuously monitor CI/CD builds and collect build status.</p><span class="arr">→</span></div>
<div class="step"><div class="num">2</div><div class="icon">⚠️</div><h3>DETECT<br>BUILD FAILURE</h3><p>Identify failed builds and capture failure logs and context.</p><span class="arr">→</span></div>
<div class="step"><div class="num">3</div><div class="icon">🧠</div><h3>AI ANALYZE &<br>SUGGEST FIX</h3><p>LLM analyzes logs, identifies root cause and suggests a fix.</p><span class="arr">→</span></div>
<div class="step"><div class="num">4</div><div class="icon">🛠️</div><h3>AUTO-FIX &<br>TRIGGER BUILD</h3><p>Apply fix on a new branch and trigger a validation build.</p><span class="arr">→</span></div>
<div class="step"><div class="num">5</div><div class="icon">✅</div><h3>VALIDATE<br>NEW BUILD</h3><p>Validate the new branch build and determine the outcome.</p><span class="arr">→</span></div>
<div class="step"><div class="num">6</div><div class="icon">🔄</div><h3>RETRY /<br>RESOLVE</h3><p>If failed, re-analyze and retry up to 2 attempts; otherwise escalate.</p></div>
</div><div class="results"><div class="result">✓ SUCCESS → Ready to Merge to Main Branch</div><div class="result fail">✕ FAILURE → Retry / Escalate</div></div><div class="retry">↻ RETRY MECHANISM — Maximum 2 Automated Attempts → Re-enter AI Analysis</div></section>
<section class="section"><div class="label">SOLUTION DESIGN</div><div class="arch">
<div class="panel"><div class="head">DATA SOURCES</div><div class="body"><p><b>Jenkins / CI Server</b><br>• Build triggers<br>• Build status<br>• Console logs</p><hr><p><b>Engineering Tools</b><br>• SonarQube<br>• Nexus / Artifactory<br>• Repository metadata</p></div></div>
<div><div class="engine"><h2>SELF-HEALING ENGINE</h2><div class="mods">
<div class="mod"><div class="ico">🎯</div><h4>1. MONITOR & DETECT</h4><p>Pipeline monitoring<br>Failure detection<br>Log collection</p></div>
<div class="mod"><div class="ico">🧠</div><h4>2. LLM ANALYSIS</h4><p>Log analysis<br>Root-cause identification<br>Fix suggestion</p></div>
<div class="mod"><div class="ico">🔧</div><h4>3. FIX + GIT AUTOMATION</h4><p>Code modification<br>Create new branch<br>Commit & push</p></div>
<div class="mod"><div class="ico">🔄</div><h4>4. RETRY CONTROLLER</h4><p>Attempt tracking<br>Workflow orchestration<br>Maximum 2 attempts</p></div>
</div></div><div class="llm"><b>LLM PROVIDER</b><br>OpenAI / Azure OpenAI / Gemini / Claude / etc.</div></div>
<div class="panel"><div class="head">BUILD & VALIDATION</div><div class="body"><p style="text-align:center;font-size:16px"><b>CI/CD Build</b></p><p>✓ Build success / failure<br>✓ Quality gates<br>✓ Automated tests<br>✓ Security checks</p><div class="out ok">SUCCESS<br><small>Ready to Merge</small></div><div class="out bad">FAILURE<br><small>Triggers Retry</small></div></div></div>
<div class="panel"><div class="head">OUTCOMES</div><div class="body"><div class="out ok">✓ SUCCESS<br><small>Ready to Merge<br>PR / MR to Main</small></div><div class="out bad">✕ UNRESOLVED<br><small>Escalate & Notify Team</small></div></div></div>
</div>
<div class="human"><div class="human-title">👥 HUMAN INTERVENTION POINTS — OUTSIDE SELF-HEALING ENGINE</div><div class="human-grid">
<div class="hi"><div class="sym">👤</div><h4>Review & Approve PR</h4><p>Review AI-generated changes before merging to main.</p></div>
<div class="hi"><div class="sym">👥</div><h4>Escalation & Notifications</h4><p>If failed after 2 attempts, notify the team for manual investigation.</p></div>
<div class="hi"><div class="sym">💻</div><h4>Manual Fix — If Required</h4><p>Developer handles issues that automation cannot safely resolve.</p></div>
<div class="hi"><div class="sym">📋</div><h4>Governance & Audit</h4><p>Maintain audit logs, approvals and automated actions for governance.</p></div>
</div></div><div class="legend"><b>LEGEND</b> <span class="green">→ Automated / Success</span><span class="red">→ Failure / Escalation</span><span class="purple">□ Human Intervention</span></div></section>
